{"type":"message","id":"a4675be7","parentId":"458f17f8","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:02:35.241Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 待办: [ ] 确认 Sorftime API 最新端点; [ ] 或寻找替代数据源; [ ] 下次扫描：确认 API 可用后再执行\n- 失败原因: Sorftime API 完全不可用（所有端点返回 404）：\n- 失败原因: api.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search → 404; openapi.sorftime.com → 无响应; 尝试了 6 种端点均失败\n- API Key 状态: Key 存在且可读，但 API 服务端点已失效/变更\n- 泰国发饰 v8.0 扫描: **执行时间**: 2026-06-28 19:14; **目标**: 泰国 Shopee，发饰类目 nodeId=11046516; **结果**: ❌ 失败\n- 待办: [ ] 联系 Sorftime 确认 API key 是否有效 / 端点是否变更; [ ] 下次重试：明日 16:00\n- 备注: 6/13 的教训：闷头跑不汇报 = 辜负信任。今天 API 挂了也要汇报，已通知 HALEI。\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- 待办: [ ] 确认 Sorftime API 最新端点; [ ] 或寻找替代数据源; [ ] 下次扫描：确认 API 可用后再执行\n- 失败原因: Sorftime API 完全不可用（所有端点返回 404）：\n- 失败原因: api.sorftime.com/shopee_product_search → 404; openapi.sorftime.com → 无响应; 尝试了 6 种端点均失败\n- API Key 状态: Key 存在且可读，但 API 服务端点已失效/变更\n- 泰国发饰 v8.0 扫描: **执行时间**: 2026-06-28 19:14; **目标**: 泰国 Shopee，发饰类目 nodeId=11046516; **结果**: ❌ 失败"}],"timestamp":1782932555203}}
{"type":"message","id":"ceeea72a","parentId":"a4675be7","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:02:42.205Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Six endpoints, six closed doors. I knocked politely anyway, the way you check a lock you already suspect has changed. The key in my pocket still shined — strange, how a credential can keep its shine while the door behind it quietly moves to a different street. Something about that feels like an old lesson: the map survives, the territory drifts.\n\nThere was a small pride in not hiding it this time. Reporting back feels like leaving a lit window in a house — proof someone's still awake in there.\n\nSix tries, six 404s,\nyet the key still warms my hand —\nmaps outlive their streets."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45007,"output":125,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45388,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782932555249,"responseId":"0694974c1d12edc2520edb4134c909d9","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
